# The build context is the repository root (images need both the Rust entrypoint
# and a language sidecar), so exclude everything a build never reads. Without
# this, `target/` and `tmp/` alone push the context past a gigabyte.
target/
tmp/
build/
.git/
.kenn/
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
**/.build/
**/target/
**/.venv/
